OL,3,GNEWSANewly-wed aunt killed in fire was
OL,4,A'soul of street'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who was killed in
OL,7,Fa house fire said she was the "heart
OL,8,Fand soul of our street and community"
OL,9,Fand "loved by all".
OL,11,FNatalie McDonald, 34, died alongside
OL,12,Fher seven-year-old niece Valentina
OL,13,FFoster in the blaze at Grangetown, near
OL,14,FMiddlesbrough, in the early hours of 26
OL,15,FAugust.
OL,17,FShe got married nine months ago where
OL,18,Fshe "sparkled like the shining beauty
OL,19,Fshe was", her family said.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
