OL,3,GNEWSANewly-wed aunt killed in fire was
OL,4,A'soul of street'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a tribute, they said: "She was loved
OL,7,Fby everyone, she was bright, bubbly and
OL,8,Ffull of life." Adding her only daughter
OL,9,Fwould "forever miss her mam".
